  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add garlic and sauté for 1 minute.",
    "Add dandelion greens and sauté until wilted, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add chicken broth, paprika, salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Stir in vanilla extract and lemon juice.",
    "Turn off heat and stir in bulgur, parsley, and cheese.",
    "Using a slotted spoon, transfer the mixture to a serving platter.",
    "Drizzle with any remaining broth and serve hot.",
    "Serve immediately, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
  ],
